## 1. Purpose

This policy sets minimum credit-file documents and retention.

## 2. Scope

Applies to consumer, residential, SME, and CRE origination files.

## 3. Thresholds

- Self-employed borrowers: {{ facts.self_employed_tax_returns }} tax returns plus YTD P&L.
- Wage earners: {{ facts.wage_pay_stubs }} and {{ facts.wage_w2 }}.
- File retention is {{ facts.file_retention }} after payoff.
- KYC refresh every {{ facts.kyc_refresh_sme }} for existing SME customers.

## 4. Authority

Incomplete files may not be approved under Delegated Credit Authority (CP-AUTH-2026-01).

## 5. Related policies

See SME Lending (CP-SME-2026-01) and Related-Party Lending (CP-RPL-2026-01).
